        "in_feature_class.title": "Event Feature Class",
        "offset_units.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies the offset units that will be used.</p><ul><li><span title=\"MILES\">Miles (US Survey)</span>—The unit of measure will be miles. This is the default.</li><li><span title=\"INCHES\">Inches (US Survey)</span>—The unit of measure will be inches.</li><li><span title=\"FEET\">Feet (US Survey)</span>—The unit of measure will be feet.</li><li><span title=\"YARDS\">Yards (US Survey)</span>—The unit of measure will be yards.</li><li><span title=\"NAUTICAL_MILES\">Nautical miles (US Survey)</span>—The unit of measure will be nautical miles.</li><li><span title=\"INTFEET\">Feet (International)</span>—The unit of measure will be international feet.</li><li><span title=\"MILLIMETERS\">Millimeters</span>—The unit of measure will be millimeters.</li><li><span title=\"CENTIMETERS\">Centimeters</span>—The unit of measure will be centimeters</li><li><span title=\"METERS\">Meters</span>—The unit of measure will be meters.</li><li><span title=\"KILOMETERS\">Kilometers</span>—The unit of measure will be kilometers.</li><li><span title=\"DECIMETERS\">Decimeters</span>—The unit of measure will be decimeters.</li></ul></xdoc>",
